        <formula area="선택지②">\text{Ni}^{2 +} ( it aq ) + 2 e^{-} \rightarrow \text{Ni} ( it s )</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">Zn ( its ) \rightarrow {} {} Zn^{2 +} ( itaq ) + 2e^{-}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">\text{Ni} ( its ) \rightarrow {} {} \text{Ni}^{2 +} ( itaq ) + 2e^{-}</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">$Zn^{2 +} ( aq ) + 2 e^{-} \rightarrow {} {} Zn ( its )$</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="true">$\text{Ni}^{2 +} ( aq ) + 2 e^{-} \rightarrow \text{Ni} ( s )$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">^($Zn ( its ) \rightarrow {} {} Zn^{2 +} ( itaq ) + 2e^{-}$)</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">^($\text{Ni} ( its ) \rightarrow {} {} \text{Ni}^{2 +} ( itaq ) + 2e^{-}$)</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">2</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="공업화학_해설.xml" question_no="18">[정답 2번] 긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기) (핵심 개념·이론 이해형) | 핵심어: 다음 전지 반응의 환원전극(cathode), Zn ( s ), Zn ( its ) | 정답 선지: $\text{Ni}^{2 +} ( aq ) + 2 e^{-} \rightarrow \text{Ni} ( s )$</explanation_ref>
    </question>
